# Third-Party Licenses

This project uses assets and code from various third-party sources. Below is a summary of the licenses.

## CC0 1.0 Universal (Public Domain Dedication)

The majority of 3D models, textures, and audio assets are released under CC0 1.0:

- **ambientCG** (Lenka Dohnalova) - PBR textures (Ground037, Concrete046, Metal021, Wood089, Bricks051, Asphalt033)
- **Poly Haven / Poly Haven Community** - HDRI (Qwantani Sunset) and 3D props (Barrel_01, barrel_03, old_tyre, wooden_crate_02, cement_bag, ammo_box, trashbag, security_light, plastic_crate_02)
- **Quaternius (Laulhet)** - Weapons (H3 pack: pistol, submachine_gun, assault_rifle, shotgun, sniper_rifle, bat), Characters (H2 pack: civil, soldier, enemy zombie, robot), Characters v2 (C6 P1: 11 humanoid models), D1 example mod pistol
- **Vuena / Popyca** - Robot character (Free Low-Poly Characters)
- **Kenney (Kenney.NL)** - Multiple 3D kits (City Roads, City Commercial, City Industrial, Building, Car, Factory, Furniture, Nature, Car Kit for vehicles)
- **Poly by Google** - Steering wheel model
- **DigitalN8m4r3 (Miodrag Sejic) / GodotVR** - Godot XR Tools low-poly hands
- **wwwriks** - WRAD Arms
- **CreativeTrio** - Baseball Bat (nails)
- **Pichuliru** - Shotgun Pump West
- **GGBotNet, domasx2, rubberduck, congusbongus, dklon, Peludo, Till Behrend, qubodup, SpringySpringo, zer0_sol, pauliuw, Michel Baradari, Vincent Sevedge, kurt, XCVG, TinyWorlds, SketchMan3, Thimras, tcarisland, Wolfgang_, DonkeyMan, Nocturnal_Vanguard, WeaponGuy, AntumDeluge, JeanMyna_VA, Scribe, StarNinjas, thebardofblasphemy, mikeask, congusbongus, rubberduck** - Audio assets from OpenGameArt
- **qubodup, Michel Baradari, congusbongus, thebardofblasphemy, mikeask, StarNinjas, DonkeyMan, Nocturnal_Vanguard, WeaponGuy, AntumDeluge, JeanMyna_VA, Scribe, XCVG** - Vocal sounds
- **Various OpenGameArt contributors** - Impact, footsteps, glass break, explosion, ambient sounds

